  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 特殊解决方案 </h2>",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/6/csm_reamCheck_cd82613a3d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»reamCheck««",
     "href": "/ch/%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81/%E9%A2%84%E8%B0%83%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F/%E7%AB%8B%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87/venturion/%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%B7/reamcheck",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»reamCheck««</h3> <p>借助»»reamCheck««，您可以全自动、快速、高重复精度且无需人工干预地对长铰刀和精镗刀等整套加工刀具进行调校。</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_torquematic_a1d5f5dc22.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»torquematic««",
     "href": "/ch/%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81/%E9%A2%84%E8%B0%83%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F/%E7%AB%8B%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87/venturion/%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%B7/torquematic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»torquematic««</h3> <p>借助»»torquematic««，可对带夹头夹具的刀具进行全自动长度调整、按预设扭矩夹紧以及测量。</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/0/csm_tribos_777b335f4d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»tribos««",
     "href": "/ch/%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81/%E9%A2%84%E8%B0%83%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F/%E7%AB%8B%E5%BC%8F%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87/venturion/%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%B7/tribos",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»tribos««</h3> <p>借助»tribos«，您可以对SCHUNK生产的TRIBOS型多边形收缩夹头进行安装和测量，其长度精度可达微米级。</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/0/csm_redomatic_e7534663d3.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»redomatic««",
     "href": "/ch/%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81/%E5%88%80%E5%85%B7%E7%83%AD%E7%BC%A9%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/redomatic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»redomatic««</h3> <p>»»redomatic«« 是用于自动化测量、预调和热缩的高端解决方案。</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/4/csm_smartCheck_704ca1e175.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»smartCheck««",
     "href": "/ch/%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81/%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F/%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F%E6%9C%BA/smartcheck",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»smartCheck««</h3> <p>»»smartCheck«« 调校、测量和检测仪可直观显示刀口端面和刀周表面的表面状况。</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    }
